      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "letters",
          "heading": "A vowel can join a consonant as a small sign. క (ka) + ా = కా (kaa). The sign ా makes the sound longer: ka → kaa.",
          "note": "Tap a big letter to hear it. Trace the light letters.",
          "items": [
